WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:18.070
01 / Familiar music, close at hand — Welcome → Home → Library → Liked songs → Now playing

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:43.994
02 / Search stays recoverable — Typed search → voice miss → retry → review results → typed fallback → offline recovery

00:00:43.994 --> 00:00:57.034
03 / A shared place for family music — Library → Family playlist → add a song → invitation permissions → invite Alex

00:00:57.034 --> 00:01:20.829
04 / Comfort and control — Speaker routing → text size → reduced motion → voice language

00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:47.290
05 / Learn the remote by trying it — Pairing failure → retry → connected → play, skip and volume → disconnect

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.992
The Listening Room / End of walkthrough — Browser prototype · synthesised audio · simulated services and Bluetooth
